                <TextRun>
                  <Value>Expand an application to see its processes, then expand a process to see its steps. This list is every step for the current filters. Statement text is one line. Hover a statement for a longer preview.</Value>
                </TextRun>
              </TextRuns>
            </Paragraph>
          </Paragraphs>
